{"unit_id":"FYL1025__dsh-remote-workspace#card-zh","repo":"FYL1025/dsh-remote-workspace","commit":"743baf9e1b212d232cc498e2f54bfef550104dfd","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-remote-workspace 是面向 DSH Web 的远程工作区插件，通过本机 SSH 连接配置的服务器，并在 DSH 界面注册远程文件服务和工作区面板。它支持管理多条 SSH 连接、浏览目录、读取和编辑文本文件、运行服务器命令，并可在对话旁停靠或切换为浮动面板。适合需要从 DSH Web 管理远程开发环境文件和执行命令的用户。运行 DSH 的主机需要 ssh、bash、base64 命令及可用的 SSH 登录配置；文件连接信息保存在浏览器 localStorage。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:112-127","lib/index.js:141-245","lib/client.js:110-127","lib/client.js:731-769"]}
{"unit_id":"FYL1025__dsh-remote-workspace#card-en","repo":"FYL1025/dsh-remote-workspace","commit":"743baf9e1b212d232cc498e2f54bfef550104dfd","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-remote-workspace is a DSH Web plugin for SSH servers. Its workspace lets users manage connections, browse directories, read and edit files, and run commands. The panel docks beside the conversation or floats. The DSH host needs ssh, bash, base64, and configured SSH login.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:112-127","lib/index.js:141-245","lib/client.js:110-127","lib/client.js:731-769"]}
