{"unit_id":"FYL1025__dsh-remote-workspace#feature-1","repo":"FYL1025/dsh-remote-workspace","commit":"743baf9e1b212d232cc498e2f54bfef550104dfd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-remote-workspace 的功能「多服务器连接」：在设置中添加 SSH 别名或主机、端口和用户名，验证连接后选择当前服务器。连接列表与当前选择保存在浏览器本地。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:110-130","lib/client.js:289-345"]}
